### Logs ###
# gradle / dev client のログは C:\Users\<name>\ の絶対パスを含む
logs/
*.log

### Internal working documents ###
# _docs/ is local-only: only the public store copy is tracked.
_docs/*
!_docs/STORE_BODY_EN.md
!_docs/STORE_SUMMARY_EN.txt

### Python ###
__pycache__/
*.pyc
